Z||000019||fropuff||05-18-2001||07:13 PM||||Well, I think I'm going to get an NOS kit as well, but I think I'll start with the lowest HP output; I think it's around 40.  I have a few questions though...1FST2M6: do you think I need the accesories the site said?  Like the bottle heater, purge kit, nitrous filter, NHRA blow-down kit, or the fuel pressure safety switch?  I think I may get the fuel pressure safety switch anyway.  Thanks a lot for the help.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters rock!||||reg||1
